## Exit criteria
- [ ] Protocol and PRISMA describe the two dimensions and their reasons
- [ ] Rank table per source with provenance; registries consulted are dated; B list versioned
- [ ] Step 2 prompt extended (discipline, contribution type) and tested on the control set before launch
- [ ] Discipline catch-up on works already re-read by Opus
- [ ] REL view: counts by reason (ICF, discipline, seriousness) and publisher sensitivity
